note = "Geo
Shuffle

***Create a new master at 120***
Almost NO contrast until 120

Tumla > Classic one with stem cutting in the circle
Rulla > Round one with perfect circle and weird diagonal construction

Some square feature alternate glyphs
> Perfect square instead of perfect circle

Compare /a.ss01 bdgpq
with /a.slant/b.slant/d.slant/g.slant/p.slant/q.slant
> Slant are too bold somehow (in bold)

Make
/f_f_i.slant/f_f_l.slant/f_f_t.slant/f_t.slant/fi.slant

Use HOI to make the variable animation REGULAR > SLANT

Write python script to inject variable substitution in the font file (designspace?) when using fontmake
#ifdef VARIABLE
condition 10 < wght < 120;
sub dollar by dollar.bold;
sub cent by cent.bold;
#endif";
